{jñānakārikā}

[prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ]



	oṃ namaḥ śivāya | siddhebhyo puruṣebhyo namaḥ | 
śrīśaṅkarapādebhyo namaḥ | apratihatatattvebhyo namaḥ |

	athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi jñānasarvaṃ (su)bhāṣitam |
	kārikā śrī(jñānā)khyātaṃ visarja jñānakārikā(m) || 1/1 ||
	kārikānāma vijñānaṃ śrūyante ca(.....)vala |
	sāmprataṃ kathayiṣyāmi yogināṃ yuktakāraṇam || 1/2 ||
	muktimārgī ca (sarva)to sarvendriyavivarjitāḥ |
	pañcapañcavinirmukto(............)varjitam || 1/3 ||
	ete surāstaṃ jñānaṃ mukti(........)vān yathāsthitaḥ |
	sarvavyā(dhi)vinirmuktaṃ yacca indriyagocara(m) || 1/4 ||
	dvādaśāntaṃ tathā(..............)śāntaṃ tathaiva ca |
	dvādaśāntaṃ kalāśataṃ varṇākṣaravivarjitam || 1/5 ||
	sarvajñañca sadā śāntaṃ (sarvā)śravavivarjitam |
	brahmā viṣṇustathā rudra īśvaraḥ śiva eva ca || 1/6 ||
	mūrtirūpaṃ sthitaṃ heturanuttaraṃ yathāsthitaḥ |
	rūpakāyaḥ sadātītaṃ mantratantrāvivarjitam || 1/7 ||
	ātmāparavinirmuktaṃ pakṣātītaṃ śrayam |
	(............................................................) lakṣaṇā || 1/8 ||
	sarvadvandvavinirmuktaṃ niścitantu nirākulam |
	sākulatvaṃ yadā cittaṃ viṣayāsaktacetasām || 1/9 ||
	tadā bhramanti saṃsāraṃ māyāmalavimohitāḥ |
	etaddvandvasamākhyātaṃ saṃsārasya tu nirṇayam || 1/10 ||
	sāmprataṃ kathayiṣyāmi muktistadastu durlabham |
	yena vijñānamātreṇa muktirbhavati yoginām || 1/11 ||
	sarvasaṃsārarahita(-)muktiścaiva nirākulam |
	niścitaṃ niścalaṃ sāmyaṃ nirdvandvaṃ ca nirākulam || 1/12 ||
	bhaven mokṣo narāṇāñca dvandvabhāvavivarjitam |
	niścittaṃ cittarahitaṃ kārikājñānamuttamam || 1/13 ||
	etadbhedaṃ mayākhyātaṃ mokṣasyaiva tu nirṇayam |
	sarvāśrayavinirmuktaṃ cittāścai(va) nirāśrayam || 1/14 ||
	cittāśrayaṃ bhaveddharmaṃ nirāśrayaṃ mokṣadaṃ smṛtam |
	devo devī tathānyañca dharmādharmavivarjitam || 1/15 ||
	dharmādharmāśrayaṃ proktaṃ saṃsārasya tu bandhanam |
	āśrayaṃ bandhamityuktaṃ muktiścaiva nirāśrayam || 1/16 ||
	nirāśrayaṃ bhavettattvamacintyamuktilakṣaṇam |
	viṣayāvasthaṃ yadā cittaṃ dvandvamuktivivarjita(m) || 1/17 ||
	tadā bhramati saṃsāraṃ yattaṃ niścayatālayaḥ |
	mano'vasthāvinirmuktaṃ yāvattaṃ cañcalībhavet |
	kathantaṃ niścalaṃ devi jñātavyaṃ jñānakārike || 1/18 ||


[iti jñānakārikāyāṃ mokṣādhikāraḥ prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ] |




[dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ]

	ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi jñānaṃ trailokyadurlabham |
	kārikātattvasadbhāvaṃ siddhanāthakulodbhavam || 2/1 ||
	candrasūryavinirmuktaṃ dvāraṇākṣavivarjitam (1) |
	pṛthivyāpastaṃ tathā yogī vāyurākāśameva ca || 2/2 ||
	pañcabhirāheto deho śrūyate tattvanāyake |
	sarveṣāṃ vyāpakaḥ śānta vyāptī tasya na vidyate || 2/3 ||
	vyāpakatve sthitaḥ sākṣādyathā kṣīreṣu sarpiṣaḥ |
	kathitaṃ tattvabhirvastu jñānaratnaṃ sudurlabham || 2/4 ||
	ātmāparavinirmuktaṃ cittaṃ caiva nirāśrayam |
	cittāśrayaṃ bhaveddvandvaṃ nirāśrayañcamauṣadam(?) || 2/5 
||
	manasastu vidhaṃ proktaṃ rājasantāmasantathā |
	sāttvikantu tṛtīyañca tribhirdharmeṇa lakṣaṇam || 2/6 ||
	tāmasaṃ cañcalaṃ kṣudraṃ rājasaṅgatirāgatiḥ |
	sāttvikaṃ tṛtīyaṃ jñeyaṃ dharmayuktaṃ sadā sthitam || 2/7 ||
	caturthantu manaścaiva kathayāmi viśeṣataḥ |
	guṇatrayavinirmuktaṃ sadā nirvāṇalakṣaṇam || 2/8 ||
	uttamottamacaturthantu yena saṃśuddhacetasā |
	sarvāgnivinayātītamindriyātītamavyayam || 2/9 ||
	anābhyāsaṃ sadā tattvaṃ sarvacintāvivarjitam |
	cittābhāvavinirmuktaṃ nimittaṃ tattvalaukikam || 2/10 ||
	abhāvaṃ bhāvanātītaṃ cittācittavivarjitam |
	cittādyacintitaṃ jñānamavācyajñānanirṇayam || 2/11 ||
	yathaiva sadātyuktāḥ tāvaccittaṃ sucañcalam |
	cañcalaṃ bhāvamityuktamacalaṃ muktilakṣaṇam || 2/12 ||
	cittāyuktaṃ yadā cittaṃ tadāsau cañcalaṃ smṛtam |
	cittātītaṃ yadā cittaṃ niścitamacalaṃ bhavet || 2/13 ||
	sarvacintāvinirmuktamabhāve niścalaṃ bhavet |
	na yogādhyātacittastu na ca lakṣaṇasādhakam || 2/14 ||
	na nirodho bhavet tatra na kāyaśūnyameva ca |
	na bahirantamantasthaṃ na cānta ādimadhyagaḥ || 2/15 ||
	na tejo vāyurākāśaṃ pṛthivyā āpabhāvanā |
	na buddhirna cāhaṃkāro na mana indriyo na ca || 2/16 ||
	na cittācittakastattvaṃ cintātītaṃ sthitaṃ sadā |
	na cintā yastu vijñeyā jñātavya kālaśāsanaḥ || 2/17 ||
	yo so niścintasarvajñaḥ samādhiparameśvaraḥ |
	jñātavyaṃ mokṣasadbhāvaṃ guptabhedaprakāśitam || 2/18 ||
	saṃsārārṇavanirmuktaṃ kalpanātītagocaram |
	nirvikalpaṃ sadā jñānaṃ kathitaṃ jñānakārikam || 2/19 ||
	cetanācetanā caiva kalpanā bhāvanāstathā |
	dhāraṇādharavinyāsacandrasūryāgnimaṇḍale || 2/20 ||
	vāyurākāśastathā sṛtyāḥ brahmā rudrādidevatāḥ |
	sarve te kalpanā proktaṃ nirvikalpastathānyathā || 2/21 ||
	kalpanājñānayuktāstu bhramanti ghaṭayantravat |
	paripūrṇaṃ kathaṃ teṣāṃ siddhakramavivarjitam || 2/22 ||
	patanti kṣipraṃ saṃsāre cittajñānena rañjitaḥ |
	na yānti ceha saṃsāre ye sthitā uttamaṃ padam || 2/23 ||
	narake gamanantasya na svarge gamanantathā |
	pāśadvayavinirūpastu dharmādharmanibandhane || 2/24 ||
	jñānakhaḍgena chitvā pāśadvayanibandhanam |
	andhapāśaṃ yadā cittaṃ kuto gacchanti yoginaḥ || 2/25 ||
	dharmādharmadvayaḥ pāśo patantyutpatanti ca |
	tena pāśena baddhastu bhuñjate karmasañcayam || 2/26 ||
	dharmeṇa bhuñjate svargamadharmaṃ narakādiṣu |
	dharmādharmau tu dvau yo'sau trailokyasya nibandhanam || 2/27 ||
	dharmādharmaṃ yadā tyaktaṃ kṣipraṃ muñcanti mānavāḥ |
	dharmā caiva adharmā dvau dvividhaṃ parikīrtitam || 2/28 ||
	sabā(hya)bhyantaracetaḥ dharmādharmapratiṣṭhitam |
	adhyātmajātasadbhāvaṃ yogināmevasaṃsthitaḥ || 2/29 ||
	laukikāsthalakarmañcādhyātmakasyedaṃ sūkṣmam |
	ādhyātmike caiva dharmādharmasthitiḥ sadā || 2/30 ||
	ūrddhvacāro bhaveddharmo'dvayasyo'dharmalakṣaṇam |
	dharmādharmakṣaye kṣīṇe mucyate sarvairdhanaiḥ (?) || 2/31 ||
	dharmādharmadvayaṃ jñātvā punarjñānamavāpnuyāt |
	dharmādharmavicāro'yaṃ kathitaṃ jñānakārikaiḥ || 2/32 ||

[iti jñānakārikāyāṃ dharmādharmavicāro nāma dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] 
||



[tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ]

	atha caryān (pra)vakṣyāmi yogināmupajāyate |
	sa cetājñāna na sarvaḥ caitanyaṃ jñānavarjitam || 3/1 ||
	cetācetasamāyuktaṃ jñānatvaṃ samprakīrtitam |
	bhuktitattvaṃ yadā cetaṃ sa cettammuktilakṣaṇam || 3/2 ||
	cetācetasamāyuktaṃ caitanyaṃ śāśvataṃ padam |
	yogināṃ yogacintitamāryasaṃjñānavarjitam || 3/3 ||
	yo mārgavinirmuktaṃ yogināṃ muktilakṣaṇam |
	ekaliṅge śmaśāne vā nadīnāṃ saṅgameṣu ca || 3/4 ||
	śūnyāgāre guhāvāse vṛkṣamūle tu catvare |
	mahodadhitaṭe caiva tripathe vāpi sādhakaḥ || 3/5 ||
	nagnāste muktakeśāstu madirānandacetasaḥ |
	mālānirmālitā yogī ekākī bhramate sadā || 3/6 ||
	liṅgantu kathayiṣyāmi yalliṅgaṃ kaulikaṃ smṛtam |
	layapūjāṣṭakaṃ yattaṃ liṅgantu sa carācaram || 3/7 ||
	laya vai yāni sarveṣāṃ tena liṅgaṃ mudā kṛtam |
	etat kaulikaṃ yalliṅgaṃ na śailahemaraupyajam || 3/8 ||
	kathitaṃ dehajaṃ liṅgaṃ ekantu na dvitīyakam |
	ekaliṅgaṃ samākhyātaṃ śmaśānaṃ kathayāmi te || 3/9 ||
	śobhate ca yadā dehaḥ sarveṣāṃ ekadehinām |
	nisvāsasvāsasaṃyuktaṃ śmaśānaṃ parikīrtitam || 3/10 ||
	adhorddhaṃ prāṇasañcāraḥ bahate caiva nityaśaḥ |
	ūrddhvacāre bhaved gaṅgā yasnā(?) cādho vyavasthitaḥ || 3/11 
||
	dvābhyāṃ melāpakaṃ yatna sa na metat (?) prakīrtitā |
	aśarīraṃ yadā tattvaṃ svadehe sā sthitā yadi || 3/12 ||
	śūnyaṃ niranñjanaṃ jñātvā mucyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
	guhyaṃ tu kathayiṣyāmi guhye sacarācaram || 3/13 ||
	guhyaṃ śarīramityuktaṃ vāsitaṃ jñānarāśinā |
	guhyāvāsaṃ sthito yogī caryā tasya na ucyate || 3/14 ||
	vāsastu kathitaṃ divyaṃ vṛkṣamūlaṃ śṛṇu tathā |
	vṛkṣaḥ śarīramityuktaṃ pādādikaraśākhayoḥ || 3/15 ||
	ūrddhvamūlaṃ bhavedvaktraṃ mūlave (?) vṛkṣadhārakam |
vṛkṣamūlaṃ tato jñātvā bāhyavṛkṣasya varjitam || 3/16 ||
	vṛkṣamūlaṃ samākhyātaṃ catvāraḥ śṛṇu sāmpratam |
	jayā ca vijayā caiva ajitā cāparājitā || 3/17 ||
	catuḥśaktisamopetaṃ catvāraṃ mātrakodbhavam |
	catvāraṃ kathitaṃ divyaṃ mahodadhitaṭaḥ śṛṇu || 3/18 ||
	bindustañca parāśaktiḥ taṭasthaḥ cārurūpiṇī |
	binducārusthitā nityaṃ taṭasthaṃ bindumaṇḍalam || 3/19 ||
	taṭasthañca sthitā yogī taṭaṃ caiva prakīrtitam |
	candraṃ tyaktvā yadā yāti ādhāraṃ sūryamaṇḍalam || 3/20 ||

(ṇumbering galata hai)

	sūryaṃ tyaktvā yadā yāti vyomā'stu candramaṇḍale |
	gaganamāsthito (?) nityaṃ velā iva mahodadheḥ || 3/72 ||
	etadvelā samākhyātam adhyātmaiva pratiṣṭhitam |
	nāsthiraṃ bhavati śvāsaṃ bahisthaṃ manarañjitam || 3/73 ||
	athiraṃ sarvayogināṃ pravāhaṃ vahate sadā |
	pravāhaṃ gamanañcaiva gamanāgamanaṃ punaḥ || 3/74 ||
	gamanāgamanasaṃyukto velā'smin yathā sthitam |
	gamāgama yathā velā nāsti rañjita kaścit (?) || 3/75 ||
	gaganopamaṃ sthitaṃ jagat bhāvanniścalatāṃ vrajet (?) |
	mahodadhitaṭe sthitvā udadhi kathitaṃ tataḥ || 3/76 ||
	niścalaṃ paripūrṇatvaṃ mahodadhi smṛtam(.......) |
	yogināṃ caryasadbhāvaṃ kathitaṃ tattvaṃ viśeṣataḥ || 3/77 ||
	mahodadhi samākhyātaṃ tripañcakaṃ kathayāmyaham |
	sattvarajastamaścaiva ekatve tu yathā sthitam || 3/78 ||
	tripathaṃ tu vinirmuktaṃ śāstrato jñānakārikā |
	tripathaṃ tu samākhyātaṃ nagnantu kathayāmi te || 3/79 ||
	avidyā(...........)patyatkāla(?) (na)gnakaṃ ca sādhakeśvaram |
	nagnastu kathitān devān muktakeśantataḥ śṛṇu || 3/80 ||
	keśastu pāśamityuktaṃ muktimārgaprabandhakam |
	dharmastu naikena pāśaścaiva viśeṣataḥ || 3/81 ||
	ṣaḍbhirmukto yadā yogī muktakeśaḥ sa ucyate |
	muktakeśaḥ samākhyāta ānandaṃ śṛṇu sāmpratam || 3/81 ||
	yogapāragato yogī mahāpāravivarjitaḥ |
	pānayogāmṛtaṃ divyaṃ yogināṃ samprakīrtitam || 3/83 ||
	ebhiryukto mahāyogī madirāmatta ucyate |
	madirānandamākhyātaṃ nairmālyamālino (?) śṛṇu || 3/84 ||
	varṇaṃ caivāsti mālāgraṃ saṃsthito śaktisūtrake |
	mālā caiva samākhyātā yogināṃ cānyakāraṇam || 
	nairmālyamālino yogī yogacaryāṃ karoti saḥ || 3/85 ||
	ekākīmatithiryastu bhramite pravadet sadā |
	asaṃhāyo bhramate dhīraḥ sa ekākīnamucyate || 3/86 ||
	ekākī tu samākhyātā śāstraṃ milakārikā (?) |
	etaccaryā samākhyātā viśa ca jñānadhāraka (?) || 3/87 ||


[iti jñānakārimahāmachindranāthapādāvatāritenoktaṃ 
caryādhikārastu tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] ||


